<http://unnethack.wordpress.com/2010/12/01/christmas-season-officially-started-on-un-nethack-nu/>

The Christmas Season has officialy been started on UnNetHack's public
server http://un.nethack.nu/.

Start a fresh game and find the magic portal to the nethackish Advent
Calendar and get yourself your daily dose of chocolate or other goodies.

A special present will be available to you behind the door for Christmas
Eve. I don't tell you what it is but I can assure you that it's neither
socks nor trousers. :-)

For those wanting spoilers, there are some in my Usenet post
http://groups.google.com/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/browse_frm/thread/d159825e0a3e1820
from back when I first released the Advent Calendar patch.

Here is an image of the Adventure Calendar level:
http://unnethack.files.wordpress.com/2010/12/advent_calendar.png

The Advent Calendar isn't in the standard UnNetHack release so this is a
public server only feature.

